# Step Task

Work defined on a process step. Shared by every project that follows the process.

◇

attributes:
    - key: num
      name: Num
      details: Order of this step task within the step.
      rules: "[0 .. unconstrained] at 1 unit"
      type_spec: Nat
    - key: name
      name: Name
      rules: unconstrained
      type_spec: STRING
    - key: description
      name: Description
      details: Work performed for this step task.
      rules: unconstrained
      type_spec: STRING
